      en: ["Originally a Moorish fortress conquered in the year 1147.", "Former headquarters of the military Order of Santiago.", "Perched at an altitude of 240 meters above sea level.", "Home to a well-preserved 15th-century stone keep.", "Severely damaged by the Great Lisbon Earthquake of 1755.", "Awarded National Monument classification in 1910."],
